---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Book a Demo | See Ceres Technology in Your Environment"
  description="Schedule a personalized Ceres walkthrough. We'll review your workflows, identify where decisions slow down, and show how to get 48–72 hour early warning on supply chain disruptions."
>
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container-lowest pt-24 pb-16 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-surface-container relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-machined-gradient opacity-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-6">
            Book a Ceres walkthrough
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose">
            Tell us a little about your business and your current bottlenecks. We will use the conversation to understand your workflows, discuss where decisions are slowing down, and show how Ceres can merge internal records with external signals in a way your team can actually use.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Form Card -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 p-8 industrial-shadow relative">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-primary"></div>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mb-6">Schedule your conversation</h2>
          <form class="space-y-5">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
              <div>
                <label class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-2">First Name</label>
                <input class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-0 border-b-2 border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface px-4 py-3 transition-colors text-sm placeholder-outline font-body" placeholder="Enter first name" type="text"/>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Last Name</label>
                <input class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-0 border-b-2 border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface px-4 py-3 transition-colors text-sm placeholder-outline font-body" placeholder="Enter last name" type="text"/>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Work Email</label>
              <input class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-0 border-b-2 border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface px-4 py-3 transition-colors text-sm placeholder-outline font-body" placeholder="name@company.com" type="email"/>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Company Size</label>
              <select class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-0 border-b-2 border-outline-variant focus:border-primary focus:ring-0 text-on-surface px-4 py-3 transition-colors text-sm appearance-none font-body">
                <option>Select size...</option>
                <option>1–50 Employees</option>
                <option>51–200 Employees</option>
                <option>201–1,000 Employees</option>
                <option>1,000+ Employees</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-4">
              <button class="w-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase py-4 text-center hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity active:scale-95 duration-75 flex justify-center items-center gap-2" type="button">
                Request Walkthrough
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant/60 text-center mt-4">By submitting, you agree to our Terms of Operation and Privacy Policy.</p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROCESS DETAILS -->
    <section class="bg-surface py-20 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-surface-container">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mb-8 border-l-4 border-primary pl-4">What to expect</h2>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex gap-6">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary text-xl border border-outline-variant/30 data-mono">01</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-headline font-bold tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-2">We learn how your team works.</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Before we show you software, we map your current operational topography. We need to understand the structural realities of your data flow.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex gap-6">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary text-xl border border-outline-variant/30 data-mono">02</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-headline font-bold tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-2">We focus on the decision problem.</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">We identify the specific inflection points where your team lacks the merged context required to act definitively.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex gap-6">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-light text-primary text-xl border border-outline-variant/30 data-mono">03</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-headline font-bold tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-2">We show how Ceres can help.</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">A targeted demonstration mapping your specific bottlenecks to our protocol's capability to ingest, normalize, and surface actionable intelligence.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 border border-outline-variant/20 h-full flex flex-col justify-center">
              <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">schedule</span>
                Why book time
              </h2>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6">
                This is not a standard software pitch. Ceres is a structural implementation designed for complex operational environments.
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">
                A live walkthrough allows us to determine if our architecture aligns with your specific technical debt and analytical requirements before engaging in a proof of concept.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TRUST SECTION -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container-lowest py-20 px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mb-4">Built for teams that need clarity, trust, and practical implementation</h2>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-primary">Verified Deployments</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant text-base leading-[1.7] mb-8 italic">"The initial consultation wasn't about selling licenses; it was a diagnostic of our entire supply chain data model. By the time we saw the console, we already knew it solved our latency issue."</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-surface-container-highest border border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">factory</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-body font-medium text-on-surface">Director of Operations</p>
                <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Global Logistics Firm</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant text-base leading-[1.7] mb-8 italic">"Ceres didn't ask us to change our existing systems. They mapped out how their protocol could sit on top and finally give our analysts a unified, trusted view of risk."</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-surface-container-highest border border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">account_balance</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-body font-medium text-on-surface">Head of Risk Analytics</p>
                <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Tier 1 Financial Institution</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL REASSURANCE -->
    <section class="bg-machined-gradient py-12 px-6 border-t border-outline-variant/30 text-center">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-on-surface flex justify-center items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-primary"></span>
        Built for serious teams with real operating needs
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-primary"></span>
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
